# Generated/vault artifacts: collapse diffs in PR review and exclude from language stats.
# GitHub cannot remove a tracked file from the "Files changed" list (see github/community #186824);
# linguist-generated only collapses the diff.
# By owner decision this covers ALL of .wm/** — including human-authored pages under .wm/wiki/**,
# which are therefore not surfaced for line-by-line review in the PR view.
.wm/** linguist-generated=true
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
